Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:28:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 34/78] nfc: add the PN5xx Android character device; use it on
 joan

Android's NXP NFC HAL drives the controller through /dev/pn54x and
PN544_SET_PWR rather than the kernel NFC subsystem.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0144VMKxYe33NKa3LLPZNivr
