 endmenu
+
+config NFC_PN5XX_ANDROID
+	tristate "NXP PN5xx Android character device"
+	depends on I2C && GPIOLIB
+	help
+	  The /dev/pn54x interface Android's NXP NFC HAL uses instead of the
